WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Mallorca, one of Spain's Balearic Islands.

2
00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:10.250
In 2025, the Balearic Islands received
15.7 million international tourists.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.130
Mass tourism brings
income, but also crowding,

4
00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.610
and pressure on water, land and heritage.

5
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.550
Since a 2016 law, visitors pay
a tax for every day they stay.

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.050
Has that small charge eased
the pressure of mass tourism?

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.390
In this mission, you'll
take the policy apart:

8
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.570
who pays, how much, and
where the money goes.

9
00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:35.950
Then you'll weigh the evidence, and
judge how far the policy has worked.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.630
Your mission: evaluate whether Mallorca's
tourist tax has eased the pressure of

11
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.720
mass tourism.
